[37.574, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[48;5;237m  \u001b[38;5;231mand drafts/c.md:\u001b[20Gan announcem\u001b[33Gnt, a\u001b[39Gstory, and a question. c\u001b[64Geate_rub\u001b[73Gic with the YAML text of \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpost-review.yaml\u001b[20G(read it and pass it\u001b[41G contents), then compare\u001b[66Gthe \u001b[71Ghree\u001b[82G (subjects \"Draft \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BA\",\u001b[7G\"Draft B\", \"Draft C\"; each a file input tagged [\"post\"] plus b\u001b[70Gief.md tagged [\"brief\"]). Each\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Br\u001b[5Gund, rewrite only the lowest-scor\u001b[39Gng\u001b[42Gdraft, using its weakest cri\u001b[71Ge\u001b[73Gion, \u001b[79Gnd compar\u001b[89G all three\u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231magain. Stop when every draft scores at least 90 and pas\u001b[59Ges,\u001b[63Gor after 4 rounds. Finally print\u001b[96Ga \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231mPOSTS table (rou\u001b[20Gd,\u001b[23GA, B, C) and the best draft.\u001b[39m                                                \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[39m Reading post-review.yaml\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf  post-review.yaml\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;114m\u25cf\u001b[39m \u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(drafts/a.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m7\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[20Gto\u001b[23G\u001b[1mdrafts/a.md\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 1 \u001b[22m19/100 \u2192 82/100 in about 3 minutes, unattended.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 2 \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m3\u001b[9G\u001b[22mNew demo\u001b[18Gvideo (17s): Claude Cod\u001b[42G on the left, a dashboard on the right. Verdict scor\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m \u001b[9G\u001b[22med an AI one-shot dashboard against GitHub's Primer design system, then the agent imp\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m \u001b[9G\u001b[22morte\u001b[14G Primer's\u001b[24Gtokens\u001b[31Gas a rubric\u001b[43Ga\u001b[45Gd r\u001b[49Gbuil\u001b[54G the page until i\u001b[72G passed.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m4\u001b[9G\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m5\u001b[9G\u001b[22mEvery\u001b[15Gcolou\u001b[21G, size and \u001b[33Gp\u001b[35Gcing value on the final\u001b[64Gis a Primer token.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B7\u001b[9G\u001b[22mWhich\u001b[15Gdesign syst\u001b[27Gm would you test this\u001b[49Gagainst?\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(drafts/b.md)\u001b[K\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
