ens (751 colours, a 7-step type scale, spacing, radii)\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m \u001b[9G\u001b[22m into\u001b[15Ga Verdict rubric, and rebui\u001b[43Gt the\u001b[49Gpage.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m4\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B5\u001b[9G\u001b[22m19 \u2192 76 \u2192 82. Passes at 80. About 3 m\u001b[47Gnutes, unattended.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 6 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m 7 \u001b[22m17-second video below. What would your one-shot score?\u001b[39m\u001b[30;1H\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
