[61.3976, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246mCalled verdict \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m times \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;231m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRound 1 scores: A 80,\u001b[25GB\u001b[27G82,\u001b[31GC\u001b[33G84.\u001b[37GAll\u001b[41Gthree\u001b[47Gpass,\u001b[53Gbut\u001b[57Gnone\u001b[62Ghas\u001b[66Greached\u001b[74G90\u001b[77Gyet.\u001b[82GA's\u001b[86Gweakest\r\u001b[1B  criterion is clarity (2.24/5), so\u001b[37GI'm\u001b[41Gcutting\u001b[49GA\u001b[51Gdown\u001b[56Gto\u001b[59Ga\u001b[61Gsingle\u001b[68Gplain\u001b[74Gidea.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;114m\u25cf\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(drafts/a.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  \u23bf \u00a0\u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m1\u001b[9G\u001b[22m 19/100 \u2192 82/100 in about 3 m\u001b[39Gnutes,\u001b[46Gunattended.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;231m\u001b[2m2\u001b[9G\u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 3 -\u001b[38;5;231mNew demo video (17s): Claude Code on the left, a dashboard on the right. Verdict sco\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m   -\u001b[38;5;231mred an AI one-shot dashboard against GitHub's Primer design system, then the agent i\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;167m   -\u001b[38;5;231mmported Primer's tokens as a rubric and rebuilt the page until it passed.           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 3 +\u001b[38;5;231mClaude Code took an AI one-shot dashboard and rebuilt it on GitHub's Primer design s\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m   +\u001b[38;5;231mystem until Verdict passed it. 17-second video below.                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 4 \u001b[22m \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 5 -\u001b[38;5;231mEvery colour, size